  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1109.02 Organization Code 10: Elementary School. The organization code 10, elementary school classification, shall be for a school organization composed of any combination of grades below grade 9, under rules adopted by the commissioner of education under Ed 306, minimum standards for public school approval.\n\nSource. #5072, eff 2-21-91, EXPIRED 2-21-97\n\nNew. #6476, eff 3-26-97; amd by #6869, eff 10-20-98; ss by #8306, eff 3-22-05; ss by #10304, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13503, eff 12-9-22",
